# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
# Grafana Cloud Kubernetes Monitoring's documented OTel-with-Prometheus-exporters alternative
# (configuration/config-other-methods/otel-collector), captured with the OpenTelemetry Collector
# Helm chart. The current source page is https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/monitor-infrastructure/kubernetes-monitoring/configuration/config-other-methods/otel-collector/
# (retrieved 2026-09-05); Context7 official library ID: /grafana/k8s-monitoring-helm.
#
# Corpus areas were decided from the 2026-09-05 worker output: it decoded 147 Kubernetes metric
# families and two OTLP log sources. They are not inferred from the documented transport or from
# the Alloy-default permutation.
PERMUTATION_TITLE="OTel Collector with Prometheus exporters"
PERMUTATION_SUMMARY="A Deployment scrapes the documented Kubernetes Prometheus exporters and remote-writes metrics; a DaemonSet ships pod logs while the Deployment ships cluster events by OTLP."
PERMUTATION_COLLECTOR="open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector"
PERMUTATION_COLLECTOR_VERSION="0.171.0"
PERMUTATION_CORPUS_AREAS="k8s logs"
PERMUTATION_CAPTURE_STATUS="proven"
PERMUTATION_DEVIATIONS="The documented Grafana Cloud remote-write and OTLP exporters, basicauth extensions, and credentials are replaced by the in-cluster capture receiver, with TLS verification skipped only for its throw-away self-signed certificate.|The documented cluster-name placeholders are set to synthkit-k3s-lab so the disposable lab has one consistent identity.|The documentation uses mutable image tag latest; the lab pins the documented contrib Collector to the OpenTelemetry chart 0.171.0 appVersion 0.158.0, rather than treating the chart version as an image tag."
